### 10. Consultar Certificado pelo Número Gerado (Retorna ID e status Draft)
GET {{TracLabs.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/certificates/by-number/CERT-2026-00001
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 11. Pré-visualizar PDF do Certificado em Tempo Real (Não grava no banco)
POST {{TracLabs.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/certificates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/preview-pdf
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

{
  "primaryColorHex": "#1E3A8A",
  "templateStyle": 0,
  "showUncertaintyBudget": true,
  "showDetailedPoints": false,
  "showSignatures": true,
  "customNotes": "Calibração realizada conforme Procedimento Interno POP-MET-012."
}

### 12. Gerar e Anexar o Documento PDF Oficial ao Certificado
POST {{TracLabs.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/certificates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/generate-pdf
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

{
  "primaryColorHex": "#1E3A8A",
  "templateStyle": 0,
  "showUncertaintyBudget": true,
  "showDetailedPoints": false,
  "showSignatures": true
}

### 13. Baixar Arquivo PDF Oficial Compilado
GET {{TracLabs.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/certificates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 14. Emitir Formalmente o Certificado (Restrito a Supervisor)
POST {{TracLabs.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/certificates/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/issue
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}

### 15. Consultar Histórico de Certificados por Equipamento
GET {{TracLabs.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/certificates/equipment/{{equipmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{supervisorToken}}
